{"change_summary":"Reworked the shrimp e2e probes so the individual tests and `all_shrimp_probes_summary` both execute the real instrumented `HarnessRun` paths, added trace-level per-tick shrimp/water snapshot notes for failure artifacts, fixed chloride protection to use real pre-treatment/treated/control runs instead of a placeholder harness state, and tightened the healthy breeding fixture/assertions so it now requires net population growth under stable husbandry. Failure diagnostics now include per-stage reserve state in human-readable probe output, and the summary runner prints results from the instrumented runs while preserving non-zero failure behavior.","outstanding_risks":["The worktree already contains unrelated pre-existing modifications outside this fix scope; they were left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Refactor shrimp probe runners so the summary path reuses the real instrumented HarnessRun scenarios instead of raw Engine-only helpers.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Strengthen the breeding scenario and chloride-protection diagnostics, including real branch-specific artifact capture and richer per-stage shrimp state output.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Add trace-level tick snapshot diagnostics for shrimp state and validate the shrimp probe suite plus tracing coverage.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_shrimp_scenario_probes all_shrimp_probes_summary -- --nocapture` passed; summary reported all 5 shrimp probes passing, with healthy breeding ending `initial=10, final=260`.","`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_shrimp_scenario_probes -- --nocapture` passed; all 6 tests in the shrimp probe file succeeded.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test tracing -- --nocapture` passed; all 23 tracing tests succeeded, including the new tick-snapshot shrimp diagnostics coverage."]}